{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, di sekolah, seorang guru wali kelas menjadi dan tanpa pandang bulu membunuh anak-anak di kelasnya. Semut hitam yang muncul kemudian menyelamatkan teman-teman sekelasnya, dan insiden ini menyebar melalui media dan media sosial, dan keberadaan di sektor tidak lagi menjadi cerita gosip perkotaan. Akhirnya, pemerintah mengajukan Bug Reaper, regu pemberantasan di sektor yang diam-diam menjalankan misi, dan mengejar semut hitam berdasarkan kesaksian yang selamat, yang identitasnya adalah siswa biasa yang tinggal dengan rumah semut yang dibangun di dalam tubuhnya. Hanya untuk menghindari dimakan oleh semut di tubuhnya, dia berubah menjadi anti-kuda di sektor dan bertarung dalam pertempuran yang tidak diinginkan.","alternative_title":"인섹터","author":"MarkerBeam","artist":"MarkerBeam","chapters":[{"number":"87","chapter":"87","slug":"c69cecb7-6b04-4afa-953d-64833dd17c40","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"86","chapter":"86","slug":"c51730db-344f-4f54-bd7f-9c24df4149f8","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"85","chapter":"85","slug":"6e2dd0c9-2723-47ec-a7d4-fab057c16c3d","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"84","chapter":"84","slug":"8017bfd2-d427-4cdc-b2e6-676d530e5371","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"6cca78b3-b21b-4d05-86fa-194ad5c5a6bb","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"92a2d5a6-c5b8-4435-be02-d4479c978b2a","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"33c68f43-05ff-4dd1-846a-cf84c7840aa6","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"9477531c-1d65-4ddf-b910-14883223728e","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"ac7aec63-59bd-400f-9e72-841ea34097a7","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2026-07-29"},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"a126e659-fcc0-4b81-971e-f34cded022ea","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2026-07-29